@startuml
title shared-library シーケンス図（Utils null判定）

actor "呼び出し元" as Client
participant "Utils" as Utils

Client -> Utils: value.isNull()
activate Utils
Utils --> Client: value == null の結果
deactivate Utils

Client -> Utils: value.isNotNull()
activate Utils
Utils -> Utils: isNull() の否定
Utils --> Client: value != null の結果
deactivate Utils
@enduml
